.TH DANBY-WHEELPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-wheelpendulum \- pendulum attached to a freely spinning wheel
.SH DESCRIPTION
The pendulum torque reacts against the wheel instead of a fixed support.  Their
angular accelerations are equal and opposite after inertia scaling, conserving
total angular momentum in the absence of gravity and damping.
.PP
Click a parameter scale to change it, space pauses, period steps, R resets, and Q exits.
